Benchmark Fixture Images
========================

Place product/test images here for the benchmark scenarios. These images are
referenced by scripts/benchmark-scenarios.ts — each scenario's `imagePath`
points to a file in this directory.

Image source requirements:
  - Do NOT commit third-party images without rights verification.
  - Use only images you have permission to use (original photos, stock images
    with appropriate license, AI-generated test images).
  - Preferred format: JPEG or PNG, 1MB max per file.
  - Recommended filenames match the pattern used in benchmark-scenarios.ts:
    - produto-eletronico.jpg
    - produto-bebida.jpg
    - produto-moda.jpg
    - produto-variedade.jpg
    - produto-saude.jpg
    - produto-alimento.jpg

If no fixture images are present, the benchmark script falls back to a
placeholder transparent PNG (no generation will succeed, but the pipeline
will be exercised and errors will be captured in metrics).
